{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏になると冷凍庫の中はアイスが満員御礼です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！116回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nかんたむさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の家では\n春夏秋冬、冷凍庫の中\nアイスが満員です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/14/6937551/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はEX大衆さんのグラビア撮影でした(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とーーーーーっても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くみなさんにみてもらいたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装やヘアメイクも\n大人っぽかったり\n新しい一面がみえるとおもいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、なんていうんだろうな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で例えたら伝わりやすいのかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！！！！そうだ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月で20歳になっても\nおかしくない感じ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、これだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくわかりやすいと思います！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな、大人な見た目で\nいろいろな衣装、\nいらいろなシチュエーションで\n撮って頂きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日とっても充実しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は、舞台もはじまるし\n刺激的な毎日を送れそう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事のあと\nお父さんとお母さんと\nコストコに行ったんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒蜜くるみバニラアイス食べて～\nホットドッグ食べて～\nジュース飲んだ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イイネ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、物を摂取するごとに\nメールで報告しようかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、暴飲暴食やめられるかも。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/14/6937551/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/14/6937551/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とお話ししたい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/14/6937551/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/14/6937551/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  たかまさ@エンジユニさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎久しぶり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎お久しぶりです！\n我は元気です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  けーたさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎じょしらく頑張ってね！観に行けなくて残念だけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ありがとうございます！\n頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームご！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  なべっかむさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ソログラビア楽しみ！\n情報解禁なったら詳しく教えてね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎早く皆さんにみてほしいな～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フィルムカメラのシャッター音が\n心地よく、カメラが欲しくなりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  もーりーーさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎メロンパンアイスなんてあるんだね！\nメロンパンとアイス同時に味わえちゃうんだね！\nなんか画期的だね！食べてみたいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎あるみたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対、じょしらく期間食べてやる～～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(513)  デーキさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎13日の金曜日\n何かが起こりそう\nドキドキして\n大声を上げたくなる～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎落ちサビを皆んなで歌うのすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13金踊ってるとき\n衣装の靴が毎回飛んでいきそうになる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の13金は\nまいちゅんの隣で踊ることが多いんですが\nBメロで下がっていくときの\nまいちゅんの動きが好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/14/6937551/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/05/14/6937551/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n105回目はげすぱさんからです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでヒナコクイズ！明日私は何個アイスを食べるでしょ～か？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、今日は\n撮影で1つ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰り道に1つ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コストコで1つ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"計、3つです。"}],"source":"archive"}